==Sootopolis City (first visit)==
[[File:Sootopolis City E.png|thumb|left|Sootopolis City]]

[[Sootopolis City]] rises from the crater of an inactive volcano and can only be reached by sea or sky. The [[Sootopolis Gym|final Gym]] in the [[Hoenn League]] is located here, but there are more urgent matters to attend to first. With [[Hoenn]]'s weather becoming increasingly oppressive, you must race to the [[Cave of Origin]] and stop the super-ancient Pokémon from destroying the entire region! A girl named [[Kiri]] lives here and will give you two Berries each day, but she will not give out Berries while {{p|Groudon}} and {{p|Kyogre}} battle. If you visit Sootopolis City before completing [[Seafloor Cavern]], you can collect all items here early (except {{hm|07|Waterfall}}). The Gym will still be closed.

